WEBVTT

00:00:00.450 --> 00:00:06.069
Video seven. Masters: the groups, the ledgers,
and the GST tax ledgers.

00:00:06.369 --> 00:00:08.721
H opens the Chart of Accounts.

00:00:09.099 --> 00:00:13.315
These are the 28 built-in groups, from Capital
Account to Suspense A/c.

00:00:13.795 --> 00:00:17.545
Your customers go under Sundry Debtors. They
pay you.

00:00:17.475 --> 00:00:21.225
Your suppliers go under Sundry Creditors. You
pay them.

00:00:21.525 --> 00:00:26.142
Esc. Then C for Create, type "led", and press
Enter.

00:00:26.844 --> 00:00:30.594
The customer: Sharma Traders, under Sundry
Debtors.

00:00:31.294 --> 00:00:36.245
Maintain balances bill-by-bill is Yes. The
credit period is 30 days.

00:00:36.275 --> 00:00:39.160
Then the address and the state: Gujarat.

00:00:39.963 --> 00:00:45.712
Under Tax Registration Details: the PAN, the
type Regular, and the GSTIN.

00:00:47.548 --> 00:00:51.831
Ctrl+A saves the ledger. The form opens again
for the next ledger.

00:00:52.911 --> 00:00:59.395
The supplier: Mehta Fabrics, under Sundry Creditors.
For the state, type "maha": Maharashtra.

00:01:00.093 --> 00:01:06.510
The GSTIN starts with 27, for Maharashtra. A
purchase from another state gets IGST.

00:01:08.882 --> 00:01:13.766
Ctrl+A. Now the bank: HDFC Bank, under Bank
Accounts.

00:01:14.465 --> 00:01:19.017
Type the account number and the IFS code.
Hisaab fills in the bank name.

00:01:21.781 --> 00:01:28.933
Ctrl+A. Then Sales Account, under Sales Accounts. GST is
applicable. The stock items give the tax rate.

00:01:29.388 --> 00:01:33.806
The purchase ledger is the same: Purchase
Account, under Purchase Accounts.

00:01:35.557 --> 00:01:41.974
The tax ledgers go under Duties & Taxes. The
type of duty is GST. Then select the tax type.

00:01:42.004 --> 00:01:45.021
CGST is Central Tax.

00:01:45.051 --> 00:01:48.003
SGST is State Tax.

00:01:48.951 --> 00:01:51.836
And IGST is Integrated Tax.

00:01:52.897 --> 00:01:56.580
Ctrl+A. Each tax ledger saves with its own tax
type.

00:01:57.660 --> 00:02:01.011
Esc, then H: the Chart of Accounts again.

00:02:01.188 --> 00:02:04.140
Each new ledger now shows under its group.

00:02:05.638 --> 00:02:09.321
Your masters are ready. Next: the stock items.

